{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8b2b733332308a31cfa8564c2a91583181b5232eff6e91b39d01c6ef58ed6c",
      "text": "…相当热闹呢。\n在玩的人看起来表情都非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e86b3d031256eba2383d444d693eeda3ad49e4779492cf31f9fbe3af42d499c",
      "text": "…宣传力度很大啊。\n没想到游戏厅里也在循环播放着PV。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a0477d2456ab4a4ef359e31f291739ab90e2b08ab68ea46e01e3babe89d1e6a",
      "text": "是啊！据说这个PV大受好评，\n大家都说“拍得太棒了”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636e762515aa07b1900ff8738967571f3e4f0c742639aa2219bd70cd3e8a2e17",
      "text": "我也非常喜欢这个PV哦！\n尤其是大吾君认真的神情特别令人印象深刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43046056137a9198a9e81779b8fa11414d697d1c2d05e963fc9b17b8270c60a6",
      "text": "哈哈。谢谢你，凉！\n确实，连我自己都觉得拍出了很棒的PV呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b59689859b06e0751a91c382c59751748e843e4e46ca4406a217bc8a21bd1d52",
      "text": "不过……一想到以后每次来游戏厅\n都会看到这段影像，就稍微有点难为情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c56d1ec1922e0b2d35574ff4f1f17e63635a1fbd8aee17b1844bef60d5511c",
      "text": "…呵。看着打出最高评级由衷高兴的大吾，\n不知不觉间自己也会想去玩玩这款游戏呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab82b7dbf32179897b7528d48644bf720359e77bc275f737256b02f97796031",
      "text": "呵呵。\n那我们也去机台前排队吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364d021bebe3fe2c408144546d755ffc7e6e009de7a23d83118bd21b2b538b36",
      "text": "噢！\n今天也要三人一起大显身手，来场合作游玩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:742a1e9a054f71d9e518f8bc39eb0983fbf4031219b9e77e9c861370cb012587",
      "text": "好，今天也要三个人一起拿下SSS！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
